---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Company — CFLabs"
  description="CFLabs builds computational infrastructure for AI and blockchain: video generation served by the second, and ASIC acceleration for zero-knowledge proving. Partners, open work and contact."
  section="company"
>
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <p class="kicker">Company</p>
    <h1>Computational infrastructure for AI and blockchain.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Two things: video generation, run on our own infrastructure and sold by the second,
      and ASIC acceleration for zero-knowledge proving. Our people come from
      semiconductors, cryptography and machine learning.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section">
    <h2>Built with</h2>
    <div class="logos" style="margin-top:30px">
      <img src="/img/logo_intchains.png" alt="Intchains Group" width="248" height="53" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/img/logo_risczero.png" alt="RISC Zero" width="83" height="61" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="/img/logo_succinct.png" alt="Succinct" width="364" height="98" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <p class="tnote" style="margin-top:26px">
      Proof-system work built around RISC Zero and Succinct's zkVMs; silicon with
      <a href="https://intchains.com/" rel="noopener">Intchains Group</a>. Part of
      <a href="https://aoraki-labs.io/" rel="noopener">Aoraki Labs</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section rule">
    <h2>Open work</h2>
    <div class="things" style="margin-top:34px">
      <article class="thing">
        <h3>Awesome Video AI Research</h3>
        <p>
          A curated index of video AI — architectures, models, datasets, inference
          optimisation and post-training — with the primary papers linked.
          <br /><a href="https://github.com/aoraki-labs-ai/Awesome-Video-AI-Research" rel="noopener">On GitHub ↗</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="thing">
        <h3>Agent Trust Stack</h3>
        <p>
          A source-linked report on trustworthy privacy and verifiable AI for the agent
          era. Every checkable number carries its source, its confidence tier and the
          observation that would overturn it.
          <br /><a href="https://github.com/aoraki-labs-ai/agent-trust-stack" rel="noopener">On GitHub ↗</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap section rule">
    <div class="cta">
      <div>
        <h2>Talk to us.</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px">
          Video generation at volume, a custom model, or acceleration work on a proving
          system.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="btnrow">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:hello@cflabs.ai">hello@cflabs.ai</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://x.com/CFrontier_Labs" rel="noopener">@CFrontier_Labs ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 8vw, 112px) clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px; align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5.8vw, 60px); max-width: 17ch; }
</style>
